- **Purpose**: Holds an instance of `aiohttp.ClientSession`. This session is used for making asynchronous HTTP requests. If no session is created, it remains `None`.
- **Usage**: The session is intended to be initialized once at the start of the application and reused throughout the application. This helps in maintaining connection pooling and other optimizations provided by `aio
*************
