# Comprehensive Natural Language Documentation for `jwql` Logging Functions

## Overview
The `jwql` logging functions provide decorators to log the execution of modules within the `jwql` automation platform. These logs are stored in the `logs/` directory of the `jwql` central storage area, named according to the module name and timestamp.

