- `_log`: An instance of the `Logger` class from the `lib.logger` module, used for logging messages.
- `_i2c_addr`: The I2C address of the IO Expander board.
- `_pin_red`, `_pin_green`, `_pin_blue`: GPIO pins connected to the RGB LED.
- `_pot_enc_a`, `_pot_enc_b`,
