### Program Overview

This program is a custom HTTP server designed to emulate a UPnP device, specifically for integration with Plex Media Server. It handles various HTTP GET, POST, and DELETE requests to provide metadata, lineup information, and live stream access. The server uses FFmpeg to handle video streaming and supports multiple concurrent connections.

### Classes and Their Purposes

