The `Simplimental` class is designed to analyze the sentiment of a given piece of text using a pre-defined dictionary of words and their associated scores. It calculates both the positivity and negativity scores of the text and then computes the overall sentiment by subtracting the negativity score from the positivity score. The class also provides comparative scores which represent the proportion of positive and negative words relative to the total number of words.

### Classes and Their Purposes

#### Class: `Simplimental`

