**Algorithm**:
- Checks if the input is an integer or a digit string.
- If it's a digit string, converts it to an integer.
- Uses a dictionary to map the last digit of the number to its ordinal suffix ("st", "nd", "rd", "th").
- Returns the formatted ordinal number.

