This Python script provides unit tests for a memcached client implementation. It uses the `unittest` framework to validate various operations such as connecting, disconnecting, setting, and getting values from a mock memcached server. The script also includes a mock connection class (`MockConnection`) to simulate the behavior of a real memcached server during testing.

### Global Variables

