- `_dead_retry`: An integer representing the number of retries before giving up on a failed operation (default is `30`).
- `_socket_timeout`: An integer representing the timeout for socket operations in seconds (default is `3`).
- `_max_receive_size`: An integer representing the maximum size of data that can be received in one go (default is `4096`).

### Classes

#### MockConnection Class

**Purpose**: Simulates the behavior of a memcached server for testing purposes.

